WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:02.653
Count the six straight sides of the hexagon.

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:07.485
A rectangle has four sides and four right angle corners.

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:13.567
A circle has a curved edge. A triangle has three sides. A square has four equal

00:00:13.567 --> 00:00:13.892
sides.

00:00:14.700 --> 00:00:19.265
A rhombus has four equal sides. Its corners do not need to be right angles.
